{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"plinq exception and cancellation plinq exception and cancellation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md","fileName":"PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"PLINQ Exception and Cancellation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 00:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[.NET Data Parallelism and PLINQ]]","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Data Parallelism and PLINQ","hands-onparallelprogrammingwithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"plinq exception and cancellation plinq exception and cancellation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md","fileName":"PLINQ Exception and Cancellation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"PLINQ Exception and Cancellation","heading":"PLINQ Exception and Cancellation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Failures thrown by parallel query delegates can be collected from several partitions and reported together, while a cancellation token gives the query an external cooperative stop signal. Both outcomes travel through query enumeration because deferred execution is when the work actually runs.\n\nA consumer must therefore place handling around materialization or iteration, not only around query construction. Delegates should avoid irreversible shared side effects because other partitions may have progressed before a fault or cancellation is observed.","tags":["baby"],"links":[".NET Data Parallelism and PLINQ","hands-onparal